<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3254] Valid SQL index configuration is not accepted in certain cases</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3254</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In certain cases involving inheritance valid SQL configuration is not accepted when run under java 8. See example in the attachment.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The reason is the different behavior of getDeclaredMethods in&lt;br/&gt;
java 7 and java 8, leading to duplication of indexes in latter.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;More details here:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://stackoverflow.com/questions/27013542/getdeclaredmethods-behaving-differently-in-java-7-vs-java-8&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://stackoverflow.com/questions/27013542/getdeclaredmethods-behaving-differently-in-java-7-vs-java-8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;java 8&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
        <key id="12976036">IGNITE-3254</key>
