                            <comment id="15372814" author="sergi.vladykin" created="Tue, 12 Jul 2016 12:41:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think the fix must be relatively easy: if we have duplications possible because of generated bridges we have to pick method with the most specific return type. If return types do not belong to the same type hierarchy, then throw exception.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
